{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868680/extras/ef61a405de663d5ad7b89de8a1fc8617.poster.avif?t=1745449042\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868680/extras/ef61a405de663d5ad7b89de8a1fc8617.webm?t=1745449042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>After years spent in hiding, the <strong>Street Cleaner</strong> becomes caught up on the trail of a mystery leading to his greatest foe yet, but this time he's not alone! Delinquent high-school brawler Honoko, and rival turned ally Cogex join in on the action, not to mention the trusty blue pup. Fight your way through locations new and remembered and swing back into the vigilante action in an all new 8-bit retro action platformer sequel to the original <i>Street Cleaner: The Video Game</i> that's bigger, badder, and better than ever before. <br><br><strong>Street Cleaner</strong> is a modern synthwave artist based in San Diego. Inspired by action films of the '80s to write the soundtrack to a vigilante movie that never existed, he has broadened his sound from retro synth inspiration to chiptunes, darksynth, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The latest album release by <strong>Street Cleaner</strong> written as the complete sound track. Over twenty tracks of trademark dance beats and dark synth.<br></li><li> Take control of the Street Cleaner and two new playable characters with different play styles and new abilities.<br></li><li> Stage based platforming action, with plenty of thrilling boss fights.<br></li><li> Stylish 8-bit retro aesthetics combined with modern visual flair like large scale pixel animations, parallax scrolling backgrounds and particle effects.<br></li><li> In game controller/keyboard remapping for convenience and accessibility.<br></li><li> Optional Assist settings, let you control things like damage taken, ammo used, double jump, knock back, etc. let you play exactly the way you want to.<br></li><li> Extra character based modes, and hard mode for extended replay value.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Comfort","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/dfbb093cf41bf647b8bb9375afe3505ed63a42b7.jpg"},{"name":"Save the City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/ed8bd201f238d85da072a0394b19a66509602f87.jpg"},{"name":"Save the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/703e64a9273931f8c043f1366fea649eb3a9c498.jpg"},{"name":"Dive Kick Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/7370e4ef1f584b645bc1ded14d85845e8e238e82.jpg"},{"name":"Grinding Gears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/aca917842e57b7c84ce85ec2572a76b827d3deb5.jpg"},{"name":"The Best Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/f95112daecf0536461f1113c1ba3fe80fbe3b615.jpg"},{"name":"Is That An Earthquake?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/7b78a7a48d3414701cdb8ec67f913bb753a8477c.jpg"},{"name":"On The Right Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/e1b713bf1369dea27bb427f51c92b9d5d9b8eb33.jpg"},{"name":"No It Ain't Safe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/fa49643f28e361e77d5793f255f7f391633ba36f.jpg"},{"name":"The True King of the Mall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868680/a6bce79a0b90142347f9faf8ff7ed0eed46eb623.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868680?t=17454490